flowchart TD
    %% Nodes
    StartPoint(開始)
    EndPoint(結束)
    ReceiveInformation(Request Information)
    ValidateInformation{驗證使用者登入資訊}
    ReturnError(返回錯誤訊息)
    CheckOrderId{檢查訂單ID}
    CheckStartDateAndEndDate{檢查起始日期與結束日期}
    QueryOrders(查詢訂單與建立者資訊)
    QueryUsers(查詢建立者資訊)
    QueryOrderItems(查詢訂單項目資訊)
    QueryProductInfo(查詢商品資訊)
    ReturnResults(返回查詢結果)



    StartPoint --> ReceiveInformation
    ReceiveInformation --> ValidateInformation
    ValidateInformation -->|驗證失敗| ReturnError
    ValidateInformation -->|驗證成功| CheckOrderId
    CheckOrderId -->|orderId為all| CheckStartDateAndEndDate
    CheckOrderId -->|orderId非all| QueryOrders
    CheckStartDateAndEndDate --> |檢查不通過| ReturnError
    CheckStartDateAndEndDate --> |檢查通過| QueryOrders
    QueryOrders --> QueryUsers
    QueryUsers --> QueryOrderItems
    QueryOrderItems --> QueryProductInfo
    QueryProductInfo --> ReturnResults
    ReturnError --> EndPoint
    ReturnResults --> EndPoint